<H3 paddingBottom="8">Hack Club</H3>
<H1 paddingBottom="16">You're already covered</H1>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">Hi {data.signer_fullName},</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">We found a Hack Club Non-Disclosure Agreement you signed on {data.nda_signedOn} through our old signing system and linked it to your account. You don't need to sign anything again.</Paragraph>
<Button paddingTop="8" paddingBottom="24" href="{data.nda_importUrl}">View your NDA</Button>
<Paragraph fontSize="13" lineHeight="160" paddingBottom="16">Or paste this link into your browser:<Br />{data.nda_importUrl}</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="14" lineHeight="160" paddingBottom="8">If you don't recognise this, write to <Link href="mailto:team@hackclub.com">team@hackclub.com</Link> and we'll look into it.</Paragraph>
<Divider width="100" paddingTop="16" paddingBottom="16" />
<Paragraph fontSize="12" lineHeight="170"><Strong>The Hack Foundation</Strong>, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit<Br />212 Battery St., Shelburne, VT 05401, USA<Br />This message concerns a legal agreement. Keep it for your records.</Paragraph>
